  "steps": [
    "In water, add 1 inch grated ginger, 5-6 minced garlic cloves, salt, and a pinch of sugar.",
    "Add 50g soya chunks and boil well. Slightly squeeze out the water.",
    "Transfer to a bowl and add salt + 2 tsp red chilli powder. Mix well.",
    "Brush a pan with little oil and cook the soya chunks for 5-7 minutes until slightly golden.",
    "Mix 5-6 tbsp Greek yogurt, 2 minced garlic cloves, 2 tsp Kashmiri red chilli powder, 2 tsp chilli flakes, 2 tsp oregano, salt, and chopped onions.",
    "Add little water if needed to adjust consistency.",
    "Add the crispy soya chunks to a plate.",
    "Top with the creamy sauce, chopped garlic, onions, and fresh coriander."
